<title>ITALY: Italy privatisation programme to go ahead on track.</title>
<headline>Italy privatisation programme to go ahead on track.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Treasury Minster Carlo Azeglio Ciampi said the country's privatisation programme would go ahead on schedule.</p>
<p>&quot;Privatisations are going ahead in line with planned commitments,&quot; he told reporters attending the annual meeting of Italy's Confindustria employers' organisation.</p>
<p>He gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
